{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34283","headline":"问吴宫辞 · 陆龟蒙","name":"问吴宫辞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"彼吴之宫兮江之郍涯，复道盘兮当高且斜。\n波摇疏兮雾蒙箔，菡萏国兮鸳鸯家。\n鸾之箫兮蛟之瑟，骈筠参差兮界丝密。\n讌曲房兮上初日，月落星稀兮歌酣未毕。\n越山丛丛兮越溪疾，美人雄劒兮相先後出。\n火姑苏兮沼长洲，此宫之丽人兮留乎不留。\n霜氛重兮孤榜晓，远树扶苏兮愁烟悄眇。\n欲摭愁烟兮问故基，又恐愁烟兮推白鸟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34283.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34283","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}